{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_forge_deployment", "label": "Finishing the Forge route", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_forge_deployment_app_id_never_committed", "label": "The registered app id never reaches HEAD", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "forge register writes a per-developer app.id into manifest.yml; committing it points every clone at one developer's app. tests/test_service.py fails on it."}, {"id": "docs_forge_deployment_suite_asserts_what_lint_cannot", "label": "What lint will not tell you, asserted by tests/test_service.py", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every scope read-only; no scope outside a reviewed allow-list; egress remote names a declared remote; resource path matches make forge-static; no app id in HEAD. Granular vs classic scopes can never be equal as strings."}, {"id": "docs_forge_deployment_reinstall_after_scope_change", "label": "After a scope change, reinstall \u2014 upgrade does not take", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An installation stays bound to the manifest it was installed with; a module added on its own upgrades (llm at 5.0.0), a scope change does not, and the failure has no error message: every Jira call returns 403."}, {"id": "docs_forge_deployment_split_build_for_csp", "label": "The Forge build is a split build, not a copy of dist/", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Custom UI iframe CSP blocks inline style and script silently, and style attributes too; build.py --split links the same four sources byte-identically, and src/app.js re-applies discarded style attributes through the CSSOM rather than asking for unsafe-inline."}, {"id": "docs_forge_deployment_bridge_adapter", "label": "The bridge adapter (forge/bridge/bridge.js)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Puts invoke() on window.__DVD_BRIDGE__ before the page loads; CommonJS inside a try because @forge/bridge throws outside a Forge iframe; a classic script linked before app.js because a deferred module sets the global after the transport decision. Seeded with an empty forge/seed.json so demo data never sits beside a tenant's. Resolvers return {status, body}."}, {"id": "docs_forge_deployment_connection_check_page", "label": "Shipping Forecast connection check admin page", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bridge, board read, projection: the calls a deploy leaves untested. Asks for a board id rather than listing boards because listing needs read:project:jira. Fifteen-second timeout because invoke() outside Forge neither resolves nor rejects."}, {"id": "docs_forge_deployment_forge_invocation_token_verifier", "label": "Forge invocation token verifier (_verify_forge_token)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four env values (JWKS URL, issuer, audience, tenant claim) as configuration not constants; pins the algorithm, looks keys up by kid with a rate-limited refetch, checks exp/nbf/aud/iss and binds the tenant. Twelve rejection cases in the suite; a real token accepted 2026-08-25 attributed to the installation ARI."}, {"id": "docs_forge_deployment_weekly_brief_trigger", "label": "The weekly brief scheduled trigger", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "llm module at 5.0.0 (major); forge eligibility reports only the calculator as egress, confirming ADR 0013. The trigger must not point at the resolver function (TypeError on functionKey, never surfaced); silence in logs carries no information, so shorten the interval to fiveMinute to find out. Proved end to end except the site's outgoing mail; asUser() throws in a trigger, which is roadmap item 5."}, {"id": "docs_forge_deployment_four_custom_fields_and_screens", "label": "Four declared custom fields and the screens they must be on", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Business Value, Value Basis, Candidate, T-Shirt Size; the app cannot put one on a screen (Administer Jira); belong on the epic screen scheme; a band declares candidacy so Candidate is optional; editmeta distinguishes not-on-site, on-no-screen, on-screen."}, {"id": "docs_forge_deployment_synthetic_input_not_evidence", "label": "A negative result from synthetic input against an embedded frame is not evidence", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Wheel and key events from browser automation do not reach a cross-origin iframe; the frame scrolls with a mouse. Versions 6.2.0-6.8.0 were fixes for a bug that did not exist."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_forge_deployment", "target": "docs_forge_deployment_app_id_never_committed", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_forge_deployment", "target": "docs_forge_deployment_suite_asserts_what_lint_cannot", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_forge_deployment", "target": "docs_forge_deployment_reinstall_after_scope_change", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_forge_deployment", "target": "docs_forge_deployment_split_build_for_csp", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_forge_deployment", "target": "docs_forge_deployment_bridge_adapter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_forge_deployment", "target": "docs_forge_deployment_connection_check_page", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_forge_deployment", "target": "docs_forge_deployment_forge_invocation_token_verifier", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_forge_deployment", "target": "docs_forge_deployment_weekly_brief_trigger", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/forge-deployment.md", "source_locati